        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7-4.1. Bulletin boards shall be provided as follows: One (1) board to a school with a faculty of 35 teachers, or less. Two (2) boards to a school with a faculty of 35 to 70 teachers. Three (3) boards to a school with a faculty of 70 teachers, or more.",
